  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Africa Land Border Programme [EALBP]</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The East Africa Land Border Security Programme aims to disrupt organised immigration crime by strengthening border security, intelligence gathering, and law enforcement capacity across key East African border regions. The programme supports partner governments to detect, investigate, and prosecute trafficking and smuggling networks, while also improving research and evidence, enhancing community reporting, and providing protection and reintegration support to victims. Overall, it aims to reduce irregular migration, protect vulnerable migrants from exploitation, and contribute to safer, more secure, and better-managed borders.</narrative>
  </description>
